****************** DOM positioning ********************************
positioning search control, paging drop down in DOM ,is called DOM positioning.	
	
The built-in options available are:

l - Length changing
f - Filtering input
t - The Table!
i - Information
p - Pagination
r - pRocessing
< and > - div elements
<"#id" and > - div with an id
<"class" and > - div with a class
<"#id.class" and > - div with an id and class	 

ex:- "dom":"<"wrapper"flipt>"  -> will generate below code
<div class="wrapper">
    { filter }
    { length }
    { info }
    { paging }
    { table }
</div>
****************** Sate Saving ********************
 we can save state of a table in jquery dataTable i.e saving current page index, page size etc.
********** Paging type *******************
pagingType ->  option.
numbers - Page number buttons only
simple - 'Previous' and 'Next' buttons only
simple_numbers - 'Previous' and 'Next' buttons, plus page numbers
full - 'First', 'Previous', 'Next' and 'Last' buttons
full_numbers - 'First', 'Previous', 'Next' and 'Last' buttons, plus page numbers
first_last_numbers - 'First' and 'Last' buttons, plus page numbers


